    "narrative": "With **Bryce Harper** anchoring the lineup at a 65.20 score, he remains our primary engine today. Facing Scott, **Harper** benefits from a favorable 3.94 xERA matchup and a prime #3 hole placement. While we are missing the offensive stability of **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez** and **Will Smith** due to IL stints, the middle of our order relies heavily on the positional flexibility of **Matt Chapman** and **Gleyber Torres**. We are keeping a close watch on **Masyn Winn** and **Geraldo Perdomo**, whose sprint speed metrics are vital given our league\u2019s obsession with stolen bases; even if their raw power numbers lag behind **Gavin Sheets** or **JJ Bleday**, their ability to swipe bags keeps them in the daily rotation as we hunt for every available point in a tight 5x5 race.\n\nOur most difficult decision today involved the final utility spot, where **Taylor Ward** narrowly edged out **Luis Arraez**. While **Arraez** provides a safer floor for our AVG category, **Ward**\u2019s situational alignment against a weaker arm and a favorable wind forecast projected a higher ceiling for run production. Meanwhile, we continue to stash high-upside prospects like **Ryan Waldschmidt**, **Dylan Beavers**, and **Jeremiah Jackson** on the bench; while **Jonathan Aranda** and **Zack Gelof** remain in the mix for future starts, their inconsistent contact profiles have forced them into a supporting role until the matchups improve. With **Cal Raleigh** and **Lawrence Butler** currently idle due to schedule gaps, the onus is on **Yainer Diaz** and **Jung Hoo Lee** to capitalize on today's matchups to prevent us from hemorrhaging ground in the standings. Be wary of late-breaking lineup changes for **Brendan Donovan** and **Tyler Freeman**, as any drop in their batting order will trigger an immediate downward adjustment to their efficiency scores. **Daulton Varsho** and **Drew Gilbert** remain secondary options who are trending upward, but until we see higher volume in their respective lineups, they will remain on the bubble.",
